Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict RNA N6-Methyladenosine Sites with a Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "yihui", family = "xu", email = "m17725297170@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: yihui xu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: yihui xu <m17725297170@163.com>
Description: Predicts candidate RNA N6-methyladenosine sites using a supplied
    random forest classifier. Provides single-site and batch prediction from
    nucleotide context, transcript annotations, GC content, log2-transformed
    length and distance features, and evolutionary conservation. Includes the
    fitted teaching model and example inputs for reproducible demonstrations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
